<!--
    Fernscroll: Media.xaml. Overlay on Playnite Default/Media.xaml.
    Stroked UI glyphs use Lucide (ISC, info/LICENSE-lucide.txt) on a 24px grid with 2px round-capped strokes
    drawn through IconTemplate in the inherited foreground. Custom filled geometries supply the theme's signature
    shapes: Play chevron (IconPlay), Fernscroll botanical reed-note & spiral mark (LocalBrandMarkGeometry),
    botanical double-spiral scroll curls (LocalScrollCurlGeometry), crimson quest shield (LocalQuestShieldGeometry),
    and harmonica eighth-note (LocalNoteGeometry).
    Menu icons (main menu, game menu) map to 48px PNGs tinted from tokens.css in Images/Lucide/.
-->
